{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704874811250.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704874821834.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">商家只需提供名称、入口仓信息，库存仿真工具即可快速输出当前的店铺运营诊断结果，并<strong>通过模拟最优仓网分配，物流费用、库存周转率、现货率、次日达、单量优化等20余组商流及供应链核心指标的量化数据，让商家直观地看到入驻智能商务仓、使用数智化供应链托管模式后带来的优化效果</strong>，以帮助商家科学决策、降低试错成本、精准创收。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704874848741.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704874963317.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">值得一提的是，库存仿真工具所模拟的加入智能商务仓后的优化效果，主要通过数智化供应链托管模式，与商家携手提升物流履约时效，并助力提升店铺星级和搜索排名。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">具体来说，商家将货物一站式交付TC，通过TC越库京东物流将根据智能系统计算结果，进行精准分货并负责运输至各仓库上架，<strong>对比传统货物送至入口仓再调拨，至少可以提升物流时效1-2天</strong>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">与此同时，库存运营专家还会为商家制定仓间调拨方案，一方面，商家无需再支付额外的仓间调拨费用，另一方面，也通过合理分配库存，让更多订单由本地发出，以提升履约效率、现货率，助力商家销量增长。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704874986428.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704874993845.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #261fee;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">某头部酒水品牌相关负责人</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ecf0f1;\">&ldquo;合作以来<span style=\"color: #261fee;\">物流费用节省了6.77%</span>，对这个年货节充满信心！经库存仿真工具诊断，因库存结构不合理、商品组套售卖关系复杂，导致履约时效差，甚至影响了长期发展。而通过库存仿真工具优化后，预计<span style=\"color: #261fee;\">周转天数可降低2.51天，跨区发货比例降低27.46%，次日达内订单占比可提升70.91%</span>。&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">接入京东物流智能商务仓后，<strong>依托智能采购、智能调拨等数智化能力，配合系统组套库存管理功能，仅2个月，该品牌的跨区订单占比降低了21%，次日达订单履约增至80%+</strong>。经过近半年的平稳运营，<strong>店铺超市标月均增长20%，订单平均妥投时长缩短5小时，店铺获评&ldquo;京东好店&rdquo;&ldquo;五星店铺&rdquo;</strong>，有效降低了品牌的资金占用和持货成本，带来配送成本和时效的优化，销量也随之大幅上涨。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704875085246.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"background-color: #261fee; color: #ffffff;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #261fee;\">&nbsp;行业观察&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">数字时代正蓬勃发展，京东物流旨在以看得见的供应链效果，助推品牌商家和行业共同实现供应链的数智化转型。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #261fee;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">扫码免费获取仿真报告</span></strong></span><br /><span style=\"color: #261fee;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">发现店铺现存问题和优化点</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704875112256.png\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content01791", "contentTitle": "科学决策、精准创收！库存仿真工具上线！", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1704677190000, "id": 4048, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1704875136022.jpg", "updateTime": 1708236035000}}